{"id":"f17461fb63885de0","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/594_子集空间逻辑_Subset_Space_Logic.md","title":"594 子集空间逻辑 Subset Space Logic","display":"594_子集空间逻辑_Subset_Space_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K,\\Box.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K,\\Box.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"KA\">\\(KA\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span>；派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本文件的命题原子直接取命题名本身；原子记号固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\\)</span>。因此形成、自由符号、替换和满足子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\)</span> 是同一个公式对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"KA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(KA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(KA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(KA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{594}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{594}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{594}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,594}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,594}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{594})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{594}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(KA,\\sigma)=K\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(KA,\\sigma)=K\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{594}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{594}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{594}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{594}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{594}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{594}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{594}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{594}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{594}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>知识公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}=\\{K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}=\\{K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}=\\{KA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}=\\{KA\\to KKA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}=\\{\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}=\\{KA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}=\\{KA\\to KKA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}=\\{\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>努力模态公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>交互公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}=\\{KA\\to\\Box KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to K\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}=\\{KA\\to\\Box KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}=\\{\\Box A\\to K\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{594}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{594}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}=\\{((A),KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}=\\{((A),KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{KA}\\ (Nec_K),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec_{\\Box}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{KA}\\ (Nec_K),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec_{\\Box}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{594}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{594}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{594}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{594}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}\\)</span>，并且每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{594}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{594}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{594}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{594}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{594}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{594}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{594}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{594}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{594}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{594}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{594}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{594}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{594}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{594}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-双模态证书\">8. 双模态证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"594\">\\(594\\)</span>-双模态证书集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertTag}_{594}=\\{KK,KT,K4,K5,BoxK,BoxT,Box4,Int1,Int2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertTag}_{594}=\\{KK,KT,K4,K5,BoxK,BoxT,Box4,Int1,Int2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{594}={}&amp;\n\\{(KK,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(KT,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(K4,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(K5,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(BoxK,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(BoxT,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(Box4,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(Int1,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(Int2,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{594}={}&amp;\n\\{(KK,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KK}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(KT,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{KT}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(K4,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{K4}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(K5,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{K5}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(BoxK,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(BoxT,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxT}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(Box4,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Box4}^{594}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(Int1,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594}\\}\n\\cup\\{(Int2,F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里各标签是互异的形式常元，证书的第二分量是对应公理集合中的实际公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目同时含知识模态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 与子集收缩模态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int1}^{594},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Int2}^{594}\\)</span> 固定二者的句法交互。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SSL}_{594}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{594},\\mathsf{Frm}_{594},\\operatorname{PV}_{594},\\operatorname{BV}_{594},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,594},\\mathsf{Subst}_{594},\\operatorname{Sub}_{594},\\mathsf{Ax}_{594},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{594},\\mathsf{Proof}_{594},\\operatorname{last}_{594},\\vdash_{594},\\mathsf{Thm}_{594},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{594},\\mathsf{Cert}_{594}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SSL}_{594}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{594},\\mathsf{Frm}_{594},\\operatorname{PV}_{594},\\operatorname{BV}_{594},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,594},\\mathsf{Subst}_{594},\\operatorname{Sub}_{594},\\mathsf{Ax}_{594},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{594},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{594},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecBox}^{594},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{594},\\mathsf{Proof}_{594},\\operatorname{last}_{594},\\vdash_{594},\\mathsf{Thm}_{594},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{594},\\mathsf{Cert}_{594}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含子集空间逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含点-开集语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-双模态证书","text":"8. 双模态证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K,\\Box.","display":true},{"tex":"KA","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{594}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{594}","displ